Official mobile app of Moscow Airport Domodedovo (DME) allows you to:

- quickly access to airport’s flight information such as schedule, departure and arrival times, gate numbers and more;
- find full information on airport’s services provided for passengers;
- obtain specific information on services provided for people with disabilities.

Moscow Domodedovo Airport is one of the largest international airports in Russia, serving 30.5 mln passengers in 2015. The best airport in Russia and the CIS, according to Skytrax. Domodedovo was chosen by leading global airline alliances – Star Alliance and oneworld – for flights to Moscow.
